        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tionne Watkins, Park So-yeon, Lisa Lopes, Anita McLoud, Edmund \"Eddie Hustle\" Clement, Kandi Burruss\n- Organizations: TLC, T-ara\n- Products: \"Girl Talk\", \"3D\"\n- Places: Des Moines, Iowa\n\nFacts:\n- Tionne Watkins was born in Des Moines, Iowa.\n- Tionne Watkins rose to fame in the early 1990s as a member of the girl group TLC.\n- Park So-yeon is best known as a former main vocalist and member of the South Korean girl group T-ara.\n- The song \"Girl Talk\" was written by Lisa Lopes, Tionne Watkins, Anita McLoud, Edmund \"Eddie Hustle\" Clement, and Kandi Burruss for TLC's fourth studio album \"3D\" in 2002.",
